ects a difference on jsonb_path_ops and generates another change.\r\n\r\nThis is my updated table/index definition:\r\n```\r\nclass AuditEvent(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"auditevent\"\r\n    id: Mapped[UUID] = mapped_column(postgresql.UUID(as_uuid=True), primary_key=True)\r\n    document: Mapped[Optional[dict]] = mapped_column(postgresql.JSONB)\r\n    __table_args__ = (\r\n         Index(\r\n                \"ix_auditevent_identifiers\",\r\n                cls.document[\"identifier\"].label(\"identifier\"),\r\n                postgresql_using=\"gin\",\r\n                postgresql_ops={\"identifier\": \"jsonb_path_ops\"},\r\n         )\r\n   )\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/comments/1769167894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tl24","id":3987166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODcxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3987166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24","html_url":"https://github.com/tl24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/comments/1769211495","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327#issuecomment-176